    fill: {type: solid, color: "$pine"}
  - elementId: hi-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [106, 437, 782, 24]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "$ink"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |-
        <p><strong>亮点:</strong>规则从代码变成可对话修订的 Skill 文档,运营自行迭代、少依赖发版——把上下文工程交给了业务(见第 13 页)。</p>
